## Alinhamento vertical##

<style>
p { margin: 10px; }
</style>

<div class="col50p terminal example" ">
vertical-align: sub;

vertical-align: super;


vertical-align: 20px;

vertical-align: -20px;
</div>
<div class=col50p>
<p>Lorem <span style="vertical-align: sub;">ipsum</span> dolor sit amet</p>
<p>Lorem <span style="vertical-align: super;">ipsum</span> dolor sit amet</p>
<p>Lorem <span style="vertical-align: 20px;">ipsum</span> dolor sit amet</p>
<p>Lorem <span style="vertical-align: -20px;">ipsum</span> dolor sit amet</p>
</div>



* Propriedade <code class=focus>vertical-align</code> altera alinhamento vertical
* Usada sobretudo em elementos em linha  <span class=litle>(como  <code class=focus>span</code>)</span>
* Os valores podem ser
    * nomes predifinidos: 
     <code class=focus>baseline</code>,
     <code class=focus>sub</code>,
     <code class=focus>super</code>,
     <code class=focus>top</code>,
     <code class=focus>text-top</code>,
     <code class=focus>middle</code>,
     <code class=focus>bottom</code>,
     <code class=focus>text-bottom</code>
    * Valores numéricos: distâncias ou percentagens
    